  "translation": "Kalo fɔlɔ na — o ye Nisan kalo ye — Ahashuwerosh ka masakɛ san tan-ni-fila na, u ye ⟨את⟩ Pur — o ye gɔrɔ daɲɛ ye — bila Hamani ɲɛ fɛ, don kɔrɔ don ani kalo kɔrɔ kalo, fo kalo tan-ni-fila la — o ye Adar kalo ye.",
